{{Quote|As we've grown over the years, we've expanded below the wall into Lower Pabu.|[[Shep Hazard]]|<ref name="Pabu" />}}
'''Lower Pabu''' was the newer part of the [[Pabu island|remote island]] on [[Pabu]]. It was wrecked<ref name="Pabu" /> during or after [[18 BBY]]<ref name="Date" /> when a [[Tsunami|sea surge]] was caused by tremors under Pabu. However, its inhabitants were able to reach the safety of [[Upper Pabu]] with the help of [[Clone Force 99]] and [[Phee Genoa]].<ref name="Pabu" />

